          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Baashani, ilmi Ahiyaa, ka gosa Isakari, Nadabuti malate, ato isaafi askartini isa dira Gibethoni ka lafa Filisti had'u jiranu, d'ufe ijeese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti kunini ganna sadeeso ka hayyu Asani lafa Yuda mohate taate, duuba akanaani Baashani fulla Nadabu hayyu Israeli tahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Hay 14.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni akuma hayyu taheeni worra Yeroboamu ch'ufa hobaase. Akuma AABBO Waaqi hojattu isaa raaga Ahiya jed'ani, ka Shilo, kaaniini jed'e, Worra Yeroboamu ch'ufa fit'ani, tokoleeni ka bahe injiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti woni kunini taateefi waan Yeroboamuni ch'ubbu hamtu tolche, worra Israeli ch'ufa ch'ubbu keesa buuse, akanaani AABBO Waaqa dallansiise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Nadabuni tolche ch'ufa kitaaba Odu Hayyoota Israeli keesati t'aafaniti t'aafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Yuda ka Asa jed'anifi hayyu Baasha jed'ani, ka Israeli, haguma worri hayyu tahe bara suni ch'ufa worra lachu woraanumati jiddu jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
