              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna sadeeso ka Asani lafa Yuda mohate keesa, Baashani, ilmi Ahiya, hayyu Israeli tahe, ganna diddami afuri Tirsa keesa lafa mohate. ",
          "type": "text",
